# AI/ML GPU kernel - explicit packages added on top of the CPU Analytics kernel.
# Edit this file, then run "make lock-ai-ml-gpu". Re-lock this kernel after any change to the parent lock.
# torch resolves from PyPI with CUDA and cuDNN as nvidia-* packages (markers limit them to linux x86_64).
-r ../cpu-analytics/requirements.in
-c ../cpu-analytics/requirements.txt
onnx
scikit-image
torch
torchmetrics
torchvision
